// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
//shinu.c
inherit NPC;
void greeting(object);
void init();
void create()
{
       set_name("慌张的侍女", ({ "shi nu","shi","nu" }) );
	set("gender", "女性" );
	set("age", 20);
	set("long", "神情慌张,似乎做了什么事情,总是向堂厅看去。\n");
	set("shen_type", -1);
	set("combat_exp", 10000);
	set("str", 20);
	set("dex", 22);
	set("con", 20);
	set("int", 21);
	set("attitude", "friendly");
	setup();
	carry_object("/d/heimuya/npc/obj/cloth")->wear();
	carry_object("/d/heimuya/npc/obj/card3")->wear();
	 add_money("silver",10);
}
void init()
{
	object ob;
	::init();
	if( interactive(ob = this_player()) && !is_fighting() ) {
		remove_call_out("greeting");
		call_out("greeting", 1, ob);
	}
}
